{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"86372cbd4b76439edb9041576abb7dfc01d63bf176d0f30946645635dc750c60","digest":{"component_or_area":"bridge suggest-mapping command","key_entities":["rebar bridge suggest-mapping","mapping_probe.py","src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/mapping_config.py","src/rebar/_cli/_parsers/advanced/bridge.py","src/rebar/_cli/_bridge_commands.py","src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py","_bridge_suggest_mapping","_config_writer._emit_nested_toml","_config_writer._emit_config_toml","jira.JIRA.issue_types","jira.JIRA.priorities","jira.JIRA.issue_link_types","jira.JIRA.statuses","jira.JIRA.createmeta_issuetypes","jira.JIRA.createmeta_fieldtypes","jira.JIRA.search_issues","jira.JIRA.transitions","pyproject.toml","rebar.toml","adapters/jira_datacenter/transport.py","adapters/jira/outbound_fields.py","tests/unit/test_jira_onboard.py","tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_probe.py"],"problem_keywords":["mapping config","jira probe","vocabulary discovery","toml serialization","axis grounding","createmeta"],"propositions":["New read-only CLI verb `rebar bridge suggest-mapping <PROJECT>` probes live Jira via pycontribs client to emit suggested `[tool.rebar.mapping]` block with discovered vocabulary (statuses, issue_types, link_types, priorities) and identity-seeded axis maps","Probe grounding uses high-level public pycontribs methods (issue_types, priorities, issue_link_types, statuses, createmeta_issuetypes, search_issues, transitions) with no private REST access or file creation/deletion","Default invocation outputs TOML to stdout (read-only); `--write` flag atomically deep-merges under existing rebar.toml preserving hand-edits and flat [jira]/[tracker] sections while adding nested [mapping.projects.KEY.*]","Transition hints are best-effort/partial (grounded in sampled issue transitions per current status), flagged as advisory; status_map stays identity-seeded","Serialization uses new orchestrator helpers _emit_nested_toml and _emit_config_toml to split flat and nested TOML tables while preserving existing _emit_toml contract and pinned test","create_defaults stubs emitted only for createmeta required:true fields absent from the outbound baseline (summary, description, issuetype, priority, assignee, conditional status/parent)"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787806061636859001,"uuid":"6ef68b42-b3b5-4897-bef2-a75551587c71"}